Value INTERFACE (\S+(?:\s+\d+)?)
Value IP_ADDRESS_PRI (\S+)
Value IP_ADDRESS_SEC ((?:no\s+address|\S+))
Value STATUS (\S+)
Value PROTOCOL (\S+)

Start
  ^Interface\s+IP-Address\(Pri\)\s+IP-Address\(Sec\)\s+Status\s+Protocol
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+${IP_ADDRESS_PRI}\s+${IP_ADDRESS_SEC}\s+${STATUS}\s+${PROTOCOL}\s*$$ -> Record
